      "instance_name": "Nazi_Germany",
      "label": "Nazi Germany",
      "description": "The historical regime led by Adolf Hitler from 1933 to 1945, characterized by totalitarianism, racial persecution, and the Holocaust. The presence of swastika banners in the image directly references this regime, which is central to understanding the historical context of the meme's message.",
